Package: frizz
Title: Takes stats from an ultiamte frisbee team and displays them in graphs
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Jason", "Tran", , "jasontran1@usf.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package takes a CSV from Ultianalytics.com of any team, and has various functions within it to clean the data and graph the data.
